title: CPS Party Conference
subtitle: The Communist Party chooses their new leader...
view-if: year = 1930 and month = 8 and cps_party_leader = "Stahler"
max-visits: 1
tags: event

= CPS Party Conference

# reference: Evans, Ellen L. “Adam Stegerwald and the Role of the Christian Trade Unions in the Weimar Republic.” The Catholic Historical Review 59, no. 4 (1974): 602–26.

The newly reformed Communist Party of Sordland now elects its leader.
The incumbent and interim chairman Denis Stahler is expected to win,however the party may return to their roots if it others are hostile to it,to represent this Old Guard Gereon Schienheiliger has been chosen. On the other hand a more Reformist Erwin Lackber could be chosen and could represent the colling of the ice with us.

- @fr: The Denis Stahler retains his position as the party chair.
- @dk: The Party selects Erwin Lackber as the party chair.
- @ms: Gereon Schienheiliger is selected as the party chairman.

@fr
subtitle: This is expected by everyone.
on-arrival: cps_ideology = "Sordish Socialism"; 

As expected Denis Stahler has been reelected as the chairman of the party.This solidifies the new brand of the party as a less Malenyevist force. 

@dk
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have good enough relations.
subtitle: Lackber is more likely to be friendly towards us
choose-if: cps_relation >= 60
on-arrival: cps_party_leader = "Lackber"; cps_relation += 10; kpd_rural += 2; cps_ideology = "Reformist Socialism"

Erwin Lackber has been chosen as the party chair. Stability has been maintained in the party. 

@ms
subtitle: This is unexpected. 
choose-if: cps_relation <= 35
on-arrival: cps_party_leader = "Schienheiliger"; cps_relation -= 15; new_middle_kpd -= 3; cps_ideology = "Malenyevism"

Gereon has been elected as the Party chair. His election signals a deterioration in relations with us and one that will never compromise with us.
